    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASV Soccer, a highly customizable arcade soccer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With ASV Soccer you can enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>22  player multiplayer for true 11 vs 11 matches</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless drop-in and drop-out</strong>. Your time is precious: from kicking a few balls in a couple of minutes, to playing multiple matches consecutively, anything goes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phsyics based ball behaviour</strong> with no predetermined outcomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive customization options:</strong>\u00a0Choose between Arcade or Realism presets, or use a custom combination: Many aspects can be customized, such as preventing the ball from leaving the field, fouls, offsides, player collision, slow-mo effects and many others.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch to any player</strong>: Perform strong well-timed tackles as defender, display vision and ball distribution as playmaker, be in the correct position and score goals as forward or keep a clean sheet as goalkeeper - it's all up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matches against AI</strong> prepare you for your multiplayer experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless switching between <strong>First Person, Third Person, and Television Camera modes</strong>  for maximum overview or maximum immersion. Play the way you like it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive controls</strong>: Carefully chose your player actions yourself. No context-aware actions bound to a single button, no auto-aim, it's all up to you. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on the go</strong>: Works great and is actively tested on the Steam Deck. Play a game wherever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting the game, and I hope you enjoy ASV Soccer. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASV Soccer, a highly customizable arcade soccer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With ASV Soccer you can enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>22  player multiplayer for true 11 vs 11 matches</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless drop-in and drop-out</strong>. Your time is precious: from kicking a few balls in a couple of minutes, to playing multiple matches consecutively, anything goes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phsyics based ball behaviour</strong> with no predetermined outcomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive customization options:</strong>\u00a0Choose between Arcade or Realism presets, or use a custom combination: Many aspects can be customized, such as preventing the ball from leaving the field, fouls, offsides, player collision, slow-mo effects and many others.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/2d3188e65a498bef4b33dfd41573667b.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch to any player</strong>: Perform strong well-timed tackles as defender, display vision and ball distribution as playmaker, be in the correct position and score goals as forward or keep a clean sheet as goalkeeper - it's all up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/edf615226928c07b803a425975b92233.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matches against AI</strong> prepare you for your multiplayer experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless switching between <strong>First Person, Third Person, and Television Camera modes</strong>  for maximum overview or maximum immersion. Play the way you like it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.poster.avif?t=1751801614\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.webm?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646710/extras/0e4c6e351609eeae776094d221e77b6f.mp4?t=1751801614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive controls</strong>: Carefully chose your player actions yourself. No context-aware actions bound to a single button, no auto-aim, it's all up to you. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play on the go</strong>: Works great and is actively tested on the Steam Deck. Play a game wherever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for supporting the game, and I hope you enjoy ASV Soccer. </p>",
    "short_description": "ASV Soccer is an up to 22 player arcade multiplayer soccer game for true 11 vs 11 matches with seamless drop-in and drop-out. Switch to first-person, third-person , and television camera modes at any time, and enjoy modern visuals with realistic physics based ball behaviour.",
